      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this sounds like a thing that could be done if VRChat allowed creators the ability to showcase public avatars on their profile the same way that their Avatar Marketplace avatars are shown in an avatar's details sheet.\n\nIf VRChat is willing to do that (and implement an avatar searching feature), then I don't know if there would be a need for this.",
